# Design-sync working output. The converter writes these wherever it is run,
# which is not necessarily a design branch — 49 MB and ~670k lines appearing as
# untracked on an unrelated feature branch is alarming enough to be worth two
# lines here. The inputs it reads (.design-sync/) live on chore/design-sync and
# are deliberately kept off main, along with the ignores specific to them.
.ds-sync/
ds-bundle/
